      <section class="why-section"><div class="outline-ball why-ball"></div><div class="blue-swoosh"></div><h2>Why us?</h2><div class="benefit-card benefit-a"><img class="benefit-icon" src="/images/icon-quality.png" alt=""/><p>Game-Ready<br/>Quality durable<br/>materials built for<br/>intense play</p></div><div class="benefit-card benefit-b"><img class="benefit-icon" src="/images/icon-flame.png" alt=""/><p>Superior Grip &amp;<br/>Control — precision<br/>feel in every move</p></div><div class="benefit-card benefit-c"><img class="benefit-icon" src="/images/icon-jersey.png" alt=""/><p>Street &amp; Pro<br/>Versatility perfect<br/>for outdoor and<br/>indoor courts</p></div><div class="benefit-card benefit-d"><img class="benefit-icon" src="/images/icon-basketball.png" alt=""/><p>Modern Design —<br/>clean style that<br/>stands out</p></div><div class="benefit-card benefit-e"><img class="benefit-icon" src="/images/icon-test-tube.png" alt=""/><p>Built for Players —<br/>tested and inspired<br/>by real basketball<br/>culture</p></div></section>

